#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/advanced-techniques-for-qaoa/extracted-outputs/761821cb-9a0c-4efb-806b-75513302d34a-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output dari sel kode sebelumnya](/docs/images/tutorials/advanced-techniques-for-qaoa/extracted-outputs/761821cb-9a0c-4efb-806b-75513302d34a-0.avif)\n"

